language design-core version 0.5.
activity ABuild.
activity AIsolated.
activity APlan.
activity AVerify.
interface Api.
usecase Browse.
channel Bus.
contract ChannelBody.
contract ChannelEvents.
message ChannelNotice.
message ChannelUpdate.
field ChannelValue.
capability Delivery.
unit Desktop.
functionality Display.
scenario Example.
usecase Export.
actor Guest.
channel IdleBus.
usecase Isolated.
container Local.
feature Navigation.
mode Offline.
mode Online.
mode Quiet.
actor Reader.
container Remote.
interface SparePort.
unit Standalone.
capability Unconnected.
ABuild addresses Display.
ABuild delivers Navigation.
ABuild has implementation-status = implemented.
ABuild refines APlan.
APlan has implementation-status = planned.
AVerify depends-on ABuild.
AVerify has implementation-status = verified.
AVerify refines APlan.
Bus upholds ChannelEvents.
ChannelBody has completeness = closed.
ChannelBody has-field ChannelValue.
ChannelEvents has completeness = closed.
ChannelEvents permits ChannelNotice.
ChannelEvents permits ChannelUpdate.
ChannelNotice has message-kind = event.
ChannelNotice upholds ChannelBody.
ChannelUpdate has message-kind = event.
ChannelUpdate upholds ChannelBody.
ChannelValue has presence = required.
ChannelValue has value-type = text.
Delivery requires Api in mode Offline.
Delivery requires SparePort in mode Online.
Desktop consumes Api.
Desktop owns Display.
Desktop provides Delivery.
Desktop uses Bus as receiver of ChannelNotice in mode Offline.
Desktop uses Bus as sender of ChannelNotice in mode Online.
Desktop uses Bus as sender of ChannelUpdate in mode Online.
Display allocated-to Local in mode Offline.
Display allocated-to Remote in mode Online.
Display contributes-to Navigation.
Display realizes Delivery.
Example has completeness = open.
Example runs-in Online.
Example step 1 sends ChannelNotice from Desktop to Remote via Bus.
IdleBus upholds ChannelEvents.
Local contains Desktop.
Navigation supports Browse.
Reader pursues Browse.
Reader pursues Export.
Remote consumes Api.
Remote uses Bus as receiver of ChannelNotice in mode Online.
Remote uses Bus as receiver of ChannelUpdate in mode Online.
Remote uses Bus as sender of ChannelNotice in mode Offline.
